   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h3> webTMS </h3> <h2> »roboBox« user interface </h2>",
   "body": "<p>The »roboBox« 's graphical user interface provides a clear overview of all available individual modules, including functions such as measuring, shrinking and cooling. In addition, status indicators are displayed for each module, showing the current status and progress of the robot's running processes. These status indicators allow users to effectively monitor the operation of the robot and identify potential problems in good time.</p>",
